{%- liquid
  capture market
    render 'size-market'
  endcapture
  assign market = market | strip
  assign page_key = section.settings.page_key | default: template.suffix
  if page_key == blank
    assign page_key = template.suffix
  endif
  if market == 'ae'
    assign layer_price = settings.comfort_layer_price_ae | strip
  else
    assign layer_price = settings.comfort_layer_price_gb | strip
  endif
-%}
<div class="rd" data-lp-page data-lp-variant="{{ section.settings.lp_variant | escape }}">
{% if page_key == 'specification' %}
<section class="rd-sec rd-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-split">
<div><p class="kicker">The specification</p>
<h1>Eight layers.<br>Each one earning<br>its place.</h1>
<p class="lede">You are spending real money on something you cannot open. So here is every layer, what it is made of, and what it does for you once you are lying on it.</p>
<div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="#layers">See the build</a><a class="btn btn--ghost btn-line" href="{{ pages['configure'].url | default: '/pages/configure' }}">Reserve yours</a></div></div>
<figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'product-floating.webp', alt: "Numa mattress in profile", width: 1600, height: 904, loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' %}</figure>
</div></div></section>

<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--bone"><div class="wrap"><div class="narrow" style="text-align:center">
<p class="kicker">Thirty five centimetres</p>
<h2>Built in two halves,<br>closed with a zip.</h2>
<p class="lede" style="margin:20px auto 0;max-width:34em">Fifteen centimetres of comfort above, twenty centimetres of support below. The top half comes out. The bottom half carries a twenty five year guarantee.</p></div>
<div class="stack">
<div><p class="d">400g</p><p class="l">Cool-knit cover</p></div>
<div><p class="d">15cm</p><p class="l">Comfort, removable</p></div>
<div><p class="d">20cm</p><p class="l">Seven-zone core</p></div>
<div><p class="d">7</p><p class="l">Support zones</p></div>
<div><p class="d">35cm</p><p class="l">Finished depth</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="rd-sec" id="layers"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sec-head narrow" style="text-align:center"><p class="kicker">Top to bottom</p><h2>Every layer, stated</h2>
<p class="lede" style="margin:16px auto 0;max-width:34em">In the order you meet them, from the surface down to the frame.</p></div>
<div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="01" data-rd-layer-name="Cool-Knit cover">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">01</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Cool-Knit cover</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">400g &middot; zip access all the way round</p>
<p>A 400 gram knitted cover, not a laminate. Knit moves air where a bonded surface holds it, so warmth leaves through the top rather than gathering under you.</p><p class="layer-benefit">It unzips the whole way round. That is how the comfort layer comes out, and it is the reason this mattress is renewed rather than replaced.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'coolknit-macro.webp', alt: "Cool-Knit cover, 400 gram", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="02" data-rd-layer-name="Gel memory foam">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">02</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Gel memory foam</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">1cm &middot; 28 density</p>
<p>The highest density we use anywhere in the build, and only one centimetre of it. Gel infusion is what stops memory foam behaving the way memory foam usually does.</p><p class="layer-benefit">It contours to your shoulder and hip without holding the heat that contouring normally creates.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'quilt-macro.webp', alt: "Quilted surface, gel layer beneath", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="03" data-rd-layer-name="Comfort foam">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">03</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Comfort foam</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">1.5cm &middot; 20 density</p>
<p>The give you feel in the first second. Softer and lower density than the gel above it, so the surface yields before the support underneath engages.</p><p class="layer-benefit">It is the difference between lying on a mattress and settling into one.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media empty"></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="04" data-rd-layer-name="Wave-profile foam">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">04</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Wave-profile foam</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">2.5cm &middot; 20 density</p>
<p>Cut into a wave rather than left flat. The profile creates channels through the middle of the comfort stack.</p><p class="layer-benefit">Air moves sideways through those channels instead of being trapped between two solid layers. It is a structural answer to heat, not a coating.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'quilt-edge.webp', alt: "Wave-profile cut, visible at the edge", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="05" data-rd-layer-name="Flippable comfort layer">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">05</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Flippable comfort layer</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">10cm &middot; 2cm at 2540 over 8cm at 2580</p>
<p>Two densities bonded into one layer, and the whole thing lifts out. One face is medium. Turn it over and it is medium firm.</p><p class="layer-benefit">You do not choose a firmness when you order. The mattress arrives with both, and if neither is right we build you a third to your description, with our compliments.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'product-floating.webp', alt: "The comfort layer sits above the core", width: 1600, height: 904, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="06" data-rd-layer-name="Seven-zone pocket spring core">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">06</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Seven-zone pocket spring core</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">20cm &middot; 7 zones &middot; 1.8 and 2.0mm wire</p>
<p>Twenty centimetres of individually pocketed springs, arranged in seven zones along the length of the bed. Heavier 2.0mm wire under the hips and shoulders where load concentrates, 1.8mm where it does not.</p><p class="layer-benefit">Each spring moves alone, so one person turning over does not move the other side. Seven zones means the bed holds your spine level instead of letting your hips drop.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'coolknit-side.webp', alt: "Side panel, over the spring core", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="07" data-rd-layer-name="Encased perimeter">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">07</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Encased perimeter</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">7cm &middot; 35 density</p>
<p>A dense foam wall around the entire spring unit, 35 density, seven centimetres deep.</p><p class="layer-benefit">You can sit on the edge to put your shoes on without sliding off it, and the usable sleeping surface runs to the seam rather than stopping short of it.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media"><figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'coolknit-handle.webp', alt: "Encased perimeter and carry handle", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure></div></div><div class="layer reveal" data-rd-layer="08" data-rd-layer-name="Anti-slip underside">
<div class="layer-n"><span class="mono">08</span></div>
<div class="layer-body"><h3>Anti-slip underside</h3><p class="layer-spec mono">Full base</p>
<p>A gripped base rather than a plain fabric one.</p><p class="layer-benefit">It stays where you put it, on a slatted frame or a divan, without the annual shove back into position.</p></div>
<div class="layer-media empty"></div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--bone"><div class="wrap"><div class="split">
<figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'quilt-macro-2.webp', alt: "Quilted surface detail", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure>
<div><p class="kicker">What it adds up to</p><h2>Softness you feel first.<br>Support you feel for<br>twenty five years.</h2>
<p style="margin-top:20px">The top five centimetres are three foams doing three different jobs: contour without heat, immediate give, and airflow through the middle. Beneath them, ten centimetres of flippable comfort layer that lifts out and can be rebuilt to your preference.</p>
<p>Under all of it, twenty centimetres of seven-zone pocket springs that will still be doing their job long after the layer above has been renewed twice.</p>
<div class="pull"><p>The part that softens comes out. The part that holds you does not.</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="rd-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="narrow">
<p class="kicker">Adjust to Desire</p>
<h2>If the feel is not right,<br>we make it right.</h2>
<p style="margin-top:22px">Sleep on it for a month. Then tell us how it should feel - softer, firmer, more give under the hip, whatever words you have. We build a new comfort layer to that description and send it, with our compliments. Worth {{ layer_price | default: '£299' }}.</p>
<p>Nothing goes back. Nothing is disassembled. You unzip the cover, lift the old layer out, drop the new one in.</p>
<div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="{{ pages['configure'].url | default: '/pages/configure' }}">Choose your size</a><a class="btn btn--ghost btn-line" href="{{ pages['manufacturing'].url | default: '/pages/manufacturing' }}">See how it is made</a></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="narrow">
<div class="sec-head" style="text-align:center"><p class="kicker">The outcome</p><h2>A bed that becomes yours,<br>and stays that way.</h2></div>
<ul class="spec">
<li><b>The feel</b><span><strong>You do not choose the feel. You discover it.</strong><br>Sleep on it for a month. Tell us how it should feel. We make it that way.</span></li>
<li><b>Arriving</b><span><strong>It arrives finished.</strong><br>Concierged. Room of your choice. Unrolled onto your bed. The old one leaves with it.</span></li>
<li><b>Twenty five years</b><span><strong>It stays right for twenty five years.</strong><br>The part that softens renews. The part that lasts, lasts.</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px"><a class="btn" href="{{ pages['configure'].url | default: '/pages/configure' }}">Choose your size</a></p>
