<p>It is also the largest size that still takes bedding you can buy anywhere, and the largest most rooms will hold without the room becoming a bed with walls around it.</p>
<p>We make to order, so the size exists because someone wants it, not because a machine was already set up for it.</p></div>
<figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'room-wide.webp', alt: "A wide bedroom with a large mattress", width: 1400, height: 781, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure>
