<p>A mattress does not wear out. The top five centimetres wear out, and the rest goes to landfill with it.</p>
<p>Ours separates. A twenty centimetre seven-zone pocket sprung core built to last twenty five years, and a comfort layer above it that unzips and lifts off.</p>
