<h1>What &pound;3,299<br>actually buys.</h1>
<p class="lede">A seven-zone pocket spring core built to last twenty five years, a comfort layer tailored to you after you have slept on it, and concierged delivery that leaves with the old one.</p>
<div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="#configure">Choose your size</a><a class="btn btn--ghost btn-line" href="#breakdown">See the breakdown</a></div></div>
