<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--bone" id="breakdown"><div class="wrap"><div class="narrow">
<div class="sec-head"><p class="kicker">Where the money goes</p><h2>What is in it</h2>
<p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px">Thirty five centimetres, built in two halves, closed with a zip.</p></div>
<ul class="spec">
<li><b>The core</b><span>Twenty centimetres of individually pocketed springs in seven zones, with 2.0mm wire under the hips and shoulders and 1.8mm elsewhere. It is the slowest part of the build and the reason it lasts.</span></li>
<li><b>The perimeter</b><span>Seven centimetres of 35 density foam encasing the whole spring unit, so the edge holds when you sit on it.</span></li>
<li><b>The comfort layer</b><span>Ten centimetres, two densities, built as its own product because it has to be replaceable. Medium one face, medium firm the other.</span></li>
<li><b>The surface</b><span>Gel memory foam, comfort foam and wave-profile airflow foam under a 400 gram cool-knit cover.</span></li>
<li><b>Made to order</b><span>Nothing is built before you buy it. No warehouse, no stock write-off, no clearance sale of last season&rsquo;s tension.</span></li>
</ul></div></div></section>

<section class="rd-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="split">
<figure class="figure ">{% render 'rd-img', file: 'product-floating-2.webp', alt: "The two halves of the mattress", width: 1400, height: 791, loading: 'lazy' %}</figure>
<div><p class="kicker">Built to come apart</p><h2>The part that softens renews.</h2>
<p style="margin-top:20px">A pocket sprung core lasts twenty five years. The five centimetres above it last seven or eight. Every mattress you have thrown away was thrown away because of the part that wears fastest, while the part doing the work was still sound.</p>
<p>Ours unzips. When the comfort layer softens you replace the layer and keep the core. It is why the mattress is built in two pieces rather than one, and why we guarantee the core for twenty five years.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--bone"><div class="wrap">
<div class="sec-head narrow" style="text-align:center"><p class="kicker">Worth knowing</p><h2>Three things people ask</h2></div>
<div class="grid-3">
<div><h3>You settle the feel after</h3><p>Sleep on it for a month, then tell us how it should feel. We make a new comfort layer to that preference, with our compliments.</p></div>
<div><h3>It is made after you order</h3><p>Which takes weeks rather than days, and is the reason nothing sits in a warehouse waiting to be discounted.</p></div>
<div><h3>It arrives finished</h3><p>Concierged to the room of your choice, unrolled onto the bed, packaging gone. The old one leaves with it.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

